          {
            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "kn",
            "text": "Where I stepped in",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "_key": "ko",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "kp",
            "text": "Left alone, every scene wanted to be the main event. The edits that mattered were subtractions: lower contrast, slower motion, a pixel-ratio cap, and a rule that only one scene is ever alive at a time.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "_key": "kq",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "kr",
            "text": "The settings menu grew out of the same instinct. If a visitor would rather have a still page, that should be one click away.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "pullQuote",
        "_key": "ks",
        "text": "The machine is generous with options. Deciding which twelve to throw away is still the job."
